{"task_id": "caesar~d2~1a0e5f5f", "family": "caesar", "domain": "code", "difficulty": 2, "attempt_kind": "win", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a precise reasoning assistant. Follow the task's output format exactly: code tasks want a single ```python block defining the required function; other tasks want <answer>...</answer>. No extra prose."}, {"role": "user", "content": "def caesar(s: str, k: int) -> str - shift each lowercase letter forward by k positions, wrapping around z->a. Non-letters never appear. Example: caesar('abc', 1) == 'bcd'.\n\nWrite ONE Python function per the signature below. Standard library only, no input()/print(). Reply with a single ```python code block, then the final word <answer>DONE</answer>. /no_think"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "```python\ndef caesar(s: str, k: int) -> str:\n    result = []\n    for char in s:\n        if char.islower():\n            shifted = ord(char) + k\n            if shifted > ord('z'):\n                shifted = shifted - 26\n            result.append(chr(shifted))\n        else:\n            result.append(char)\n    return ''.join(result)\n```\n\n<answer>DONE</answer>"}]}
