{"task_id": "rle~d5~0038372f", "family": "rle", "domain": "code", "difficulty": 5, "attempt_kind": "win", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a precise reasoning assistant. Follow the task's output format exactly: code tasks want a single ```python block defining the required function; other tasks want <answer>...</answer>. No extra prose."}, {"role": "user", "content": "def rle(s: str) -> list - run-length encode: return a list of (character, run_length) tuples in order. Example: rle('aabb') == [('a', 2), ('b', 2)].\n\nWrite ONE Python function per the signature below. Standard library only, no input()/print(). Reply with a single ```python code block, then the final word <answer>DONE</answer>. /no_think"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "```python\ndef rle(s: str) -> list:\n    if not s:\n        return []\n    result = []\n    i = 0\n    while i < len(s):\n        result.append((s[i], 1))\n        j = i + 1\n        while j < len(s) and s[j] == s[i]:\n            j += 1\n        result[-1] = (s[i], j - i)\n        i = j\n    return result\n```\n\n<answer>DONE</answer>"}]}
